  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Mwanamake, Amanu na Usalama 2.0 programme works on women, peace, and security in Democratic Republic of Congo (North and South Kivu) and Burundi. The programme&apos;s objective is that women and girls in DRC and Burundi participate meaningfully in conflict prevention, resolution, mediation, peacebuilding and protection. The MAnU 2.0 Consortium consists of Mensen met een Missie, CARE Nederland, and SPR  (Synergie des Femmes pour la Paix et la R&#xE9;conciliation des Peuples des Grands Lacs d&#x2019;Afrique). MAnU 2.0 is funded by the Dutch Ministry of Foreign Affairs for five years - 2021-2025.</narrative>
  </description>
